{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:945ffb3f6db236c3","name":"Hyperspace Explorer Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-945ffb3f6db236c3","title":"Hyperspace Explorer Talent Tree","revision":19165,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:26:45Z","sha256":"968fd2ecf161f1edebc61df936cb42e555024b6f42bb4f35d5a460ccabc17da7","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19165","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Hyperspace%20Explorer%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-945ffb3f6db236c3","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are an experienced deep-space explorer who has learned a few tricks along the way that help you survive both in space, and planet-side.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Deep-Space Gambit"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, when you or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," you occupy are the target of an attack roll, you can force your opponent to reroll the attack. The opponent must keep the worse of the two results.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Guidance"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You know how to guide others through treacherous terrain. You may use a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to point out the path of least resistance to an ally within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," who can see, hear, and understand you. The ally ignores the effect of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Difficult Terrain"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Difficult_Terrain"}," on its next turn. You cannot use this Talent on yourself.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Hidden Attacker"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Your shots seem to come from nowhere. Whenever you use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Snipe"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Snipe"}," application of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," skill, you do so as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," instead of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Hyperspace Savant"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can substitute your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," skill for any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check made to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Astrogate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Astrogate"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Sensors"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Sensors","referenceId":"reference:1bf2e88f5409e504"}," while you are the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Vehicle Sneak"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You know how to fly and operate your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," in order to hide its approach visually, decrease the noise it produces, and minimize its sensor signature. Treat your ship as two size categories smaller when attempting ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," checks.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Additional Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Silent Movement"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You know how to move silently in almost any environment. You never suffer from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unfavorable Circumstances"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unfavorable_Circumstances"}," from environmental effects associated with noise when you ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sneak"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sneak"}," using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," skill. Once per round, when you make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," check, you can automatically use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aid Another"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aid_Another","referenceId":"reference:276932074aab1852"}," Action on one ally's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," check.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
